sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as CLI
  participant P as Pipeline

  U->>C: lineup run "<task>"
  C->>P: runPipeline()
  P-->>C: status updates

  alt human mode
    C-->>U: print progress to stderr
    P-->>C: gate request
    C-->>U: interactive question
    U-->>C: answer in terminal
    C->>P: continue
  else host mode
    C-->>U: emit protocol output
    P-->>C: gate request
    U->>C: lineup gate respond ...
    C->>P: continue
  end
